    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 30,
       "endIndex": 111,
       "text": "**In isolation for Google L6:** **Yes, it is in the upper quartile of the L6 band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 216,
       "endIndex": 342,
       "text": "**RSUs ($1.08M):** Strong for an L6 PM offer (standard L6 bands typically top out around $900k\u2013$1M without special approval)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 370,
       "endIndex": 460,
       "text": "Google regularly uses sign-on bonuses to bridge unvested equity or close senior candidates"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 586,
       "endIndex": 697,
       "text": "**Leveling Mismatch:** Meta IC6 (Principal / Lead PM) typically maps to **Google L7** (Group PM / Principal PM)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 699,
       "endIndex": 760,
       "text": "Google L6 (Senior PM) is generally the equivalent of Meta IC5"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 762,
       "endIndex": 850,
       "text": "Google is effectively down-leveling you or bringing you in at the absolute ceiling of L6"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 854,
       "endIndex": 973,
       "text": "**The \"Google Vesting Cliff\":** Google standardly uses a front-loaded **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** 4-year vesting schedule"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 980,
       "endIndex": 1061,
       "text": "**Years 1 & 2:** Base ($235k) + Bonus ($47k) + Equity ($356.4k) = **~$638k/year**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1257,
       "endIndex": 1486,
       "text": "While annual equity refreshes stack, they are tied to performance ratings (GRAD) and are not guaranteed to fully compensate for the Year 3/4 drop if you are leaving Meta's standard 25% quarterly vesting and strong refresher cycle"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1674,
       "endIndex": 1773,
       "text": "You are walking away from unvested Meta RSUs, strong internal capital, and an impending bonus cycle"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1776,
       "endIndex": 1866,
       "text": "You should not accept as-is, but you shouldn't walk away without testing the ceiling first"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1921,
       "endIndex": 2048,
       "text": "Your goal is to push the offer to top-of-band and secure a sign-on bonus to offset the unvested equity you leave behind at Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2148,
       "endIndex": 2280,
       "text": "| **Base Salary** | $235,000 | **$255,000 \u2013 $265,000** | Top of the posted $271k band; reflects your current IC6 base compensation"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2284,
       "endIndex": 2418,
       "text": "| **New-Hire RSUs** | $1,080,000 | **$1,200,000 \u2013 $1,250,000** | Offsets the Year 3/4 front-load cliff and accounts for senior scope"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2422,
       "endIndex": 2545,
       "text": "| **Sign-on Bonus** | $0 | **$75,000 \u2013 $100,000** | Standard tool for buying out unvested Meta equity and forfeited bonus"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2788,
       "endIndex": 3009,
       "text": "*\"Given that my scope at Meta is IC6 (which typically aligns with L7 scope in the market), entering at L6 means I\u2019m taking on significant risk unless the compensation package reflects top-of-band execution from Day 1.\"*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3268,
       "endIndex": 3334,
       "text": "A sign-on bonus in the $75k\u2013$100k range would bridge that gap.\"*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3372,
       "endIndex": 3556,
       "text": "*\"To make this a compelling move from a team and role I genuinely enjoy, I\u2019d be excited to sign if we can get base closer to $260k and bring the equity grant to $1.2M over 4 years.\"*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3699,
       "endIndex": 3891,
       "text": "If they refuse to move on base, equity, or sign-on, you are better off staying at Meta where your IC6 momentum and equity refreshes will likely out-earn this package over a 3-to-4-year horizon"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2,
       1
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
